# Web3Forms access key — relays the contact form to your inbox.
# Get one free at https://web3forms.com (enter your email, it's mailed to you).
#
# This is NOT a secret. Anything prefixed VITE_ is inlined into the JavaScript
# bundle at build time, so every visitor can read it. That's fine here: the key
# only ever delivers to the address that created it, so the worst it can do is
# send you mail. Never put a real secret behind a VITE_ prefix.
#
# Copy to .env.local and fill in, or set it in your host's env vars.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
